The Descendants are a nomadic people of [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]]. [[People/Althane/Big Fish|Big Fish]] was one of them, and after the Deep was destroyed [[People/Althane/Dawnmonger|Dawn]] left gifts of his technology for them.
